objects. Could be anything.

00:00:33.599 --> 00:00:36.135
Once the curtain opens,
you have to pick up your card

00:00:36.135 --> 00:00:38.438
and you have 45 seconds
to try to get the other person

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:40.073
to guess what's behind them.

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:42.642
You can say anything you want
or use gestures.

00:00:42.642 --> 00:00:45.444
You just can't say any
of the words on your card.

00:00:45.444 --> 00:00:48.814
Drew, you'll be guessing first.
Let's get into position.

00:00:48.814 --> 00:00:50.516
